** The data library: the specification module of the folder lib/data/. `data.rows`, `data.quality`, `data.infer` and `data.stream` are its modules; their functions are also members of `data`.
** @spec spec/library/data.md#rules-of-import  @feature F-LIB-03  @decision D-239  @tests test/level3/c99_data_rows
module data is
  from rows export (*);
  from quality export (*);
  from infer export (*);
  from stream export (*);
end data;
